40" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Dynamic Table&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;HARMONIZED_CLINICAL_EVENT&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;Normalized units, mapped synonyms&#10;Specimen-level pathology tracking&#10;TARGET_LAG = '1 minute'&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="800" width="280" height="100" /></mxCell><mxCell id="241" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Dynamic Table&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;READINESS_GATE_STATE&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;5 gates × versioned rules:&#10;Clinical · Surveillance · Documentation&#10;Coverage · Identity&#10;Outcome: pass/fail/not_evaluated/conflicting&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="370" y="790" width="300" height="110" /></mxCell><mxCell id="242" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Dynamic Table&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;REVIEW_QUEUE&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;Gate failures weighted by&#10;days-to-next-visit&#10;Owner assignment&#10;Never called 'patient risk'&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="720" y="800" width="250" height="100" /></mxCell><mxCell id="243" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Dynamic Table&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;TREATMENT_PLAN_CURRENT&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;Latest plan version per patient&#10;Regimen, cycle count, modifications&#10;From Dipali: 4 plan changes in 18mo&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F0FDF4;strokeColor=#16A34A;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" ve