;Indexed: DOC_PAGE where scope='patient'&#10;Attributes: patient_id, doc_id,&#10;page_index, doc_version&#10;Filter: patient_id (server-injected)&#10;&lt;b&gt;Owner's rights — no direct access&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1000" width="320" height="110" /></mxCell><mxCell id="250" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Cortex Search Service&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;REFERENCE_DOCS&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;Indexed: REF_DOC_PAGE&#10;Attributes: jurisdiction,&#10;effective_date, doc_type&#10;No patient data in this service&#10;&lt;b&gt;Structurally separate (R6)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="410" y="1000" width="300" height="110" /></mxCell><mxCell id="251" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Semantic View&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;b&gt;SAARTHI_COHORT&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;Cortex Analyst — cohort queries&#10;Entities: patients, encounters,&#10;clinical events, gate states&#10;Verified Query Repository:&#10;5 pre-verified queries for Q1-Q6&#10;Policies propagate from base tables&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="760" y="990" width="300" height="120" /></mxCell><mxCell id="252" parent="1" value="R5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1E40AF;fontStyle=1;arcSize=20;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="300" y="1110" width="40" height="20" /></mxCell><mxCell id="253" parent="1" value="R6" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1E40AF;fontStyle=1;arcSize=20;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="650" y="1110" width="40" height="20" /></mxCell><mxCell id="254" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;SNOWFLAKE — AGENT &amp;amp; ROUTING LAYER&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;strokeDasharray=6 3;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#475569;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;arcSize=4;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="20" y="1170" width="1560" height="220" /></mxCell><mxCell id="255" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Class A/B Classifier&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;Clinical judgment → REFUSE&#10;Record/coverage state → ANSWER&#10;Edge cases pre-mapped&#10;(should-close-gaps.md §3)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1210" width="230" height="100" /></mxCell><mxCell id="256" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;REFUSED&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;Routed to treating team&#10;with evidence packet&#10;'Your treating team decides'&#10;NMC TPG 2020 compliant&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FEF2F2;strokeColor=#B91C1C;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="40" y="1320" width="230" height="50" /></mxCell><mxCell id="257" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;6 SQL Procedures&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;(scope as bound parameter on every one)&#10;&#10;1. get_patient_facts(patient_id, domain, known_as_of)&#10;2. get_readiness(patient_id, encounter_id, known_as_of)&#10;3. search_patient_documents(patient_id, query, known_as_of)&#10;4. search_reference_documents(query, jurisdiction, date)&#10;5. cohort_query(question)&#10;6. create_review_task(..., idempotency_key)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;dashed=0;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="320" y="1200" width="440" height="150" /></mxCell><mxCell id="258" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Deterministic Router&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;PRIMARY path&#10;Classifies → selects tool → calls procedure&#10;Scope bound before tool call&#10;No LLM in the routing decision&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#CBD5E1;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;dashed=0;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="810" y="1200" width="250" height="90" /></mxCell><mxCell id="259" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Cortex Agent&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;LAYER on top (when runtime confirmed)&#10;Wraps same 6 procedures&#10;AGENT_RUN() via SQL (fallback)&#10;Immutable session attributes for R5&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#EFF6FF;strokeColor=#2563EB;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="810" y="1310" width="250" height="70" /></mxCell><mxCell id="260" parent="1" value="R1" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1E40AF;fontStyle=1;arcSize=20;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="700" y="1355" width="40" height="20" /></mxCell><mxCell id="261" parent="1" value="R5" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#DBEAFE;strokeColor=#3B82F6;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=9;fontColor=#1E40AF;fontStyle=1;arcSize=20;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1000" y="1355" width="40" height="20" /></mxCell><mxCell id="262" parent="1" value="Class A" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;strokeColo