="269" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;SNOWFLAKE — ANSWER VALIDATION &amp;amp; OUTPUT&lt;/b&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=none;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=1;strokeDasharray=6 3;fontSize=13;fontStyle=1;fontColor=#475569;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=10;arcSize=4;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="20" y="1430" width="1560" height="200" /></mxCell><mxCell id="270" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer Validator&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;5 deterministic checks:&#10;1. Evidence existence (claim → ≥1 ID)&#10;2. Scope membership (patient/tenant)&#10;3. Version currency (within known_as_of)&#10;4. Polarity (AI_FILTER — negation guard)&#10;5. Type match (numeric/date/status)&#10;&#10;Fails closed: unsupported → STRIPPED&#10;Replaced with explicit limitation&#10;Removal LOGGED in ANSWER_RUN&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="320" y="1460" width="440" height="150" /></mxCell><mxCell id="271" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;ANSWER_RUN&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;Persisted audit artifact&#10;Stores pointers, NOT content&#10;(DPDP Rule 6(e) compliance)&#10;question, role, scope, known_as_of,&#10;claims→evidence map, validation_results,&#10;model_version, timing&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F1F5F9;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="810" y="1460" width="280" height="120" /></mxCell><mxCell id="272" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;Cortex Guard&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;On every generation call&#10;Model safety flag&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1140" y="1460" width="180" height="50" /></mxCell><mxCell id="273" parent="1" value="raw answer" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;" edge="1" source="258" target="270"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="274" parent="1" value="raw answer" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;" edge="1" source="259" target="270"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="275" parent="1" value="validated answer" style="edgeStyle=orthogonalEdgeStyle;rounded=1;orthogonalLoop=1;jettySize=auto;exitX=0.5;exitY=1;exitDx=0;exitDy=0;entryX=0.5;entryY=0;entryDx=0;entryDy=0;strokeColor=#64748B;strokeWidth=1.5;fontSize=10;fontColor=#64748B;" edge="1" source="270" target="271"><mxGeometry as="geometry" relative="1" /></mxCell><mxCell id="276" parent="1" value="&lt;b&gt;GOVERNANCE LAYER&lt;/b&gt;&#10;&lt;font point-size='9'&gt;(Enterprise Edition features)&#10;&#10;• Row Access Policies on every&#10;  evidence-bearing table&#10;• Masking policies + PHI tags&#10;• CURRENT_USER() for viewer identity&#10;• QUERY_HISTORY for live leakage proof&#10;• (ACCESS_HISTORY lags 180 min)&#10;&#10;Standard Edition fallback:&#10;• Secure views with CURRENT_ROLE()&#10;  conditional predicates&#10;• QUERY_HISTORY (all editions)&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFBEB;strokeColor=#B45309;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=11;fontColor=#1F2937;verticalAlign=top;spacingTop=6;arcSize=6;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry as="geometry" x="1140" y="1520" width="300" height="100" /></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>